<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of December 9 to December 13, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors have been net buyers for the past five weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   599.30 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  555.04 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  44.26 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying	12.51 billion yen</p>
</text>
